<title>USA: Clark County, Nev., GOs won by Lehman at 5.832 pct.</title>
<headline>Clark County, Nev., GOs won by Lehman at 5.832 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Tuesday it won $97.9 million Clark County, Nev., general obligation bonds at a 5.832 percent true interest cost.</p>
